WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:02.396
(crowd clapping)
- All right, everybody.

00:00:02.396 --> 00:00:03.480
Let's dip into the world

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.890
of social media before we go,

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:06.217
this is What I'm Liking.

00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:08.790
(crowd clapping)

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.950
All right, the big game is this Sunday.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.990
And all week we are sharing great stories

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.249
to get you focused on football,

00:00:14.249 --> 00:00:16.080
'cause it's incredible.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.368
As a Cowboys fan, it's not so incredible.

00:00:19.368 --> 00:00:20.485
(crowd laughs)
I'm still devastated

00:00:20.485 --> 00:00:22.290
that we lost the wildcard game.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.734
It's fine.

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.100
But this video put a smile on my face.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.750
And more than a smile,
I laughed hysterically.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.740
I almost peed my pants.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.090
A wife recorded her husband,

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.801
'cause we are these, I am this husband.

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:35.460
A wife recorded her
husband watching that loss

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.138
and his reactions were so predictable,

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:39.285
she created a bingo drinking game,

00:00:39.285 --> 00:00:41.910
marking the squares as he stressed out.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.301
Take a look.

00:00:43.301 --> 00:00:46.301
(upbeat game music)

00:01:05.238 --> 00:01:07.821
(fan grunting)

00:01:11.258 --> 00:01:13.020
(crowd cheering)
This is my favorite

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.010
What I'm Liking.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.954
Because I have never related more.

00:01:15.954 --> 00:01:17.400
I don't know if you could see it,

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.668
but my favorite is the square

00:01:18.668 --> 00:01:21.492
that says aggressively pets dog.

00:01:21.492 --> 00:01:23.340
(crowd laughing)

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.550
Which I have completely
done to my poor Henry.

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:28.050
I've been like, oh my God.

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.619
Like, well he's got a lot of fur.

00:01:29.619 --> 00:01:31.950
But we have that couple
on the line right now.

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.320
Everybody say hello to
Mackenzie and Justin,

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.360
watching on NBC five Dallas-Fort Worth.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.234
What's up y'all?
(crowd cheers)

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.706
- Hi Kelly.

00:01:39.706 --> 00:01:42.149
- So does he act this way for all games?

00:01:42.149 --> 00:01:43.410
- Oh yes.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:46.470
So, we've been watching
Cowboys games together

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.120
for about seven years now.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.480
And he's been reacting the
same way for seven years.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.682
You know, he yells the same things,

00:01:53.682 --> 00:01:57.030
he uses the same gestures, he sits

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.000
in the exact same spot, and he even wears

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.670
the same exact thing every single game

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:04.740
because he is so superstitious.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.060
- Yes.
- And you know,

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.190
now I have learned to love the Cowboys

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:09.210
and be a Cowboys fan.

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.241
And that's why I made this Bingo card.

00:02:11.241 --> 00:02:13.770
- So Justin, you make
your own clothing, right?

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.116
Was that an outfit you made?

00:02:15.116 --> 00:02:18.363
- Yeah, I actually made
those shorts in college.

00:02:19.455 --> 00:02:21.690
I just made 'em as ridiculous as possible.

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.549
I actually have 'em right here.

00:02:23.549 --> 00:02:26.280
I look about four feet
tall when I wear 'em.

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.713
And then we actually have a 1-year-old now

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:30.240
and so he got his own little pair.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.695
- Yes!
(crowd awing)

00:02:31.695 --> 00:02:32.931
- So, these are amazing.

00:02:32.931 --> 00:02:34.531
- Oh my gosh!

00:02:34.531 --> 00:02:38.940
- So he, yeah he gets
to join the very bitter,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.490
bittersweet lifestyle of a Cowboys fan.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:42.420
- Cowboy nation.

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:43.863
Yeah, there we go.

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.740
- Yeah, so he gets to watch the morning

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.270
and afternoon games with us.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.711
And then for the nighttime games,

00:02:49.711 --> 00:02:52.260
I actually wear a pair of oven mitts

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.959
so I can clap without waking him up, so...

00:02:54.959 --> 00:02:55.792
(crowd laughs)
- Oh my god, I know.

00:02:55.792 --> 00:02:57.240
'Cause the box that says quiet clap,

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.710
'cause anyone with kids knows that.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:02:59.580
It's like yeah.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.490
Oh my God, I love it so
much. It is so relatable.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.740
Thank you so much Mackenzie.
You are hilarious.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.581
Justin, keep wearing those shorts

00:03:06.581 --> 00:03:08.730
or maybe don't 'cause
they're not good luck.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.260
I don't know.
(crowd laughs)

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:12.180
I don't know. Let's
just try something new.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.470
How about that, Cowboy nation?

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.580
- How about that?
- I'm loving

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.230
your post right now, I'm liking it.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.160
And that's not all.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.930
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.390
makers of Precise, the go-to
pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:23.538
sympathize with cowboy fans everywhere,

00:03:23.538 --> 00:03:26.241
so they will be writing you a
check for a thousand dollars.

00:03:26.241 --> 00:03:27.651
(crowd applauding)
- There you go.

00:03:27.651 --> 00:03:29.583
- Oh my God, thank you so much.

00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:31.084
- Awesome.
- Look Justin,

00:03:31.084 --> 00:03:34.230
I'm gonna keep wearing my Cowboy onesie.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.000
You keep wearing your shorts.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.530
We're gonna get there.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.352
Next season, next season guys.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.423
(crowd cheering)
Thank you to all

00:03:41.423 --> 00:03:43.378
our guests this hour, Dwayne Wade,

00:03:43.378 --> 00:03:46.028
Callum Turner, Jay
Shetty, and Lawrence Gary.

00:03:46.028 --> 00:03:46.861
Y'all have a great day.

00:03:46.861 --> 00:03:48.211
And if it's not, change it.

